ADDENDA <Rule No. 1123, Jul. 31, 2025>

Article 1 (Enforcement Date) These Rules shall enter into force on the date of their promulgation.

Article 2 (Provisions Concerning Implementation of Supply and Demand Estimates for Healthcare Personnel) "The time prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of Health and Welfare" in the proviso to Article 1 of the Addenda to Act No. 20922, the Act Partially Amending the Framework Act on Health and Medical Services, means the time specified for each of the following categories:

1. Matters concerning supply and demand estimates for occupations other than physicians under the amended provisions of Articles 22 and 23-2 of the Framework Act on Health and Medical Services, as partially amended by Act No. 20922:
(a) Doctors of Korean medicine under Article 2 of the Medical Service Act and nurses under Article 2 of the Nursing Act: January 1, 2027;
(b) Dentists under Article 2 of the Medical Service Act and pharmacists and herbal pharmacists under Article 2 of the Pharmaceutical Affairs Act: January 1, 2028;
(c) Medical technologists under Article 1-2 of the Act on Medical Technologists, etc.: January 1, 2029.

2. Matters concerning supply and demand estimates under the amended provisions of Article 23-2 (2) 2 and 3 of the Framework Act on Health and Medical Services, as partially amended by Act No. 20922:
(a) Physicians and doctors of Korean medicine under Article 2 of the Medical Service Act and nurses under Article 2 of the Nursing Act: January 1, 2027;
(b) Dentists under Article 2 of the Medical Service Act and pharmacists and herbal pharmacists under Article 2 of the Pharmaceutical Affairs Act: January 1, 2028;
(c) Medical technologists under Article 1-2 of the Act on Medical Technologists, etc.: January 1, 2029.
